  "Line": {
    "DefaultText": "The wolf breaks eye contact for a moment and exhales through its nose.\n\n“Perhaps. Leave a heart beneath some bones… beneath a full moon.”",
    "Text": "狼偏移目光片刻，鼻尖吐出一息。\\n\\n“或许吧。满月之下，留心与骨。”",
    "zh": "狼偏移目光片刻，鼻尖吐出一息。\\n\\n“或许吧。满月之下，留心与骨。”",
    "en": "The wolf breaks eye contact for a moment and exhales through its nose.\\n\\n“Perhaps. Leave a heart beneath some bones… beneath a full moon.”",
    "ja": "オオカミは一瞬だけ視線を逸らし、鼻から息を吐く。\\n\\n「あるいはな。骨の下に心臓を置け・・・満月の下で」"
  },
